WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Release decisions begin with comparable
runs and mandatory floors.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:08.640
Use the same held-out corpus and versioned
conditions to examine behavior,

00:00:08.691 --> 00:00:12.280
regression, denial and workflow limits.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:16.400
A failed critical scenario triggers
a hold and investigation even

00:00:16.453 --> 00:00:19.680
if the average improves. When floors hold,

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:24.520
reviewers inspect remaining regressions
and uncertainty before a bounded rollout.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:29.040
Agree the thresholds locally and retain
the scenario-level decision evidence.
